<title>USA: Valley Resources Q2 shr $0.76 vs $0.91.</title>
<headline>Valley Resources Q2 shr $0.76 vs $0.91.</headline>
<dateline>CUMBERLAND, R.I. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.76		    $0.91</p>
<p> Net		 3,260		    3,855</p>
<p> Revs		30,932		   30,250</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   4,261,726		4,258,330</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS period</p>
<p> Net share	 $0.80		    $0.94</p>
<p> Net		 3,407		    3,987</p>
<p> Revs		83,287		   77,476</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  4,258,316		4,245,389</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Quarter and year ended Feb. 28, 1997 and Feb. 29, 1996.</p>
<p>The company said earnings for the quarter declined primarily due to warm weather and the inability to generate off-system gas sales by the utilities.</p>
</text>
